\item \strong{TR4 (revised MAP; Velicer, Eaton, & Fava, 2000):} the analogous
fourth-power summary, formed from the trace of the fourth matrix power,
\deqn{\mathrm{TR4}_m = \frac{\mathrm{tr}(M^4) - p}{p(p-1)}.}
